      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The endless loop of grief is exhausting, and it's completely understandable that you feel this way when everything feels meaningless. You're pouring so much of yourself into a situation that offers no return, and that is profoundly draining. If the weight of this caregiving and the hopelessness of the future are becoming too much, please know that there are resources available to help you cope with this immense strain. Talking to someone can provide a different perspective on what you're enduring right now.",
